  Slug: witch-lessons
  DisplayName: Witch Lessons
  IconPath: icons/equipment/head/hat-pointed-leather-pink.webp
  Description: 'A witch''s knowledge from their patron comes in the form of lessons,
    which you can learn by selecting feats like Basic Lesson. Each lesson grants
    you a hex and teaches your familiar a new spell, adding it to the spells you
    can prepare using your witch spellcasting. You gain this spell even if it''s
    not on your tradition''s spell list. BASIC LESSONS You can select from these
    lessons when a feat or another effect grants you a basic lesson. Lesson of Dreams
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Veil of Dreams] hex, and your
    familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sleep]. Lesson of the Elements
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Elemental Betrayal] hex. Your
    familiar learns your choice of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Breathe
    Fire], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Air Bubble], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hydraulic
    Push], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pummeling Rubble]. Lesson of
    Life You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Life Boost] hex, and
    your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spirit Link]. Lesson
    of Protection You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blood Ward]
    hex; your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mystic Armor].
    Lesson of Vengeance You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Needle
    of Vengeance] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantom
    Pain]. Uncommon Lesson of Calamity: You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Stumbling
    Curse] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ill
    Omen]. GREATER LESSONS You can select from these lessons when a feat or other
    effect grants you a greater lesson. Lesson of Mischief You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Deceiver''s
    Cloak] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mad
    Monkeys]. Lesson of Shadow You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Malicious
    Shadow] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Chilling
    Darkness]. Lesson of Snow You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Personal
    Blizzard] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall
    of Wind]. Lesson of Favors You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Return
    the Favor] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mind
    of Menace]. Lesson of Decay All living things eventually decay, feeding fungus
    and insect. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mycological Malady]
    hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Insect Form].
    Lesson of the Flock Power flows when many work as one. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sheltering
    Wings] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Levitate].
    Lesson of the Shark Learn the ways of this deadly oceanic predator. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blood in the Water] hex, and your familiar
    learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Feet to Fins]. MAJOR LESSONS You
    can select from these lessons when a feat or other effect grants you a major
    lesson. Lesson of Bargains You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Over
    the Coals] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Subconscious
    Suggestion]. Lesson of Death You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Curse
    of Death] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Raise
    Dead]. Lesson of Renewal You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Restorative
    Moment] hex, and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Field
    of Life]. Rare Lesson of Frozen Queen You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Glacial
    Heart] hex and your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall
    of Ice].'
